<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CI/CD DevOps Project</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #f4f6f8;
            text-align: center;
        }

        header {
            background: #222;
            color: white;
            padding: 25px;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0;
        }

        .container {
            margin: 60px auto;
            max-width: 700px;
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .pipeline {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .stage {
            padding: 15px 20px;
            background: #e8f0fe;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 50px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #222;
            color: white;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>CI/CD DevOps Project</h1>
        <p>Automated Application Deployment</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">

        <h2>Welcome to My CI/CD Project</h2>

        <p>
            This application is deployed using a CI/CD pipeline
            with GitHub, Jenkins, Docker, and AWS.
        </p>

        <h3>CI/CD Pipeline</h3>

        <div class="pipeline">
            <div class="stage">GitHub</div>
            <div class="stage">Jenkins</div>
            <div class="stage">Build</div>
            <div class="stage">Test</div>
            <div class="stage">Docker</div>
            <div class="stage">AWS</div>
        </div>

        <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
            🚀 Code → Build → Test → Deploy
        </p>

    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>CI/CD Demo Project | DevOps</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
